<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates fell</p>
<p>at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Wednesday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate fell two basis points to 3.14 percent.</p>
<p>					Oct 9 fix	     Oct 8 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.11 pct		3.10 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.13 pct		3.13 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.14 pct		3.16 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.22 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.30 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.39 pct		3.42 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
